  "intro_text": "**MTH 256 \u2014 Quiz 3 Preparation**\n\nDue: Tuesday, November 10, 2026, at 11:59:59 p.m. America/Los_Angeles (PST).\n\nProfessor Pat\u2019s announcement:\n\n> Hi All,\n>\n> I posted Written Homework 4 and WebWork 4. Problems 1 and 2 of Written Homework 4 and 1-9 of the WebWork 4 relate to material that will be assessed on Quiz 3 which has been pushed back to week 7.\n>\n> Best,\n>\n> Pat\n\nStudy scope: the 15 topics mapped to Written Homework 4 problems 1\u20132 and WebWork 4 problems 1\u20139, plus all their prerequisite ancestors that are in your saved targets. The study scope also includes Reduction of Order, General Solutions of First-Order Linear ODEs, and General Solutions of Linear ODEs. All 108 topics are included in global layer order, including topics already studied. Each item links to its topic for study or review."
